1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,730
AI words sound complicated.

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:03,970
They're mostly just normal ideas wearing

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:04,590
a lab coat.

4
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:07,330
AI means software that can do tasks we

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,040
usually associate with people, like

6
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:11,300
writing, seeing, sorting, or deciding.

7
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:12,720
A model is the engine.

8
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,540
It has learned patterns from tons of

9
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:15,120
examples.

10
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,790
An L L M, or large language model, is a

11
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,730
model that predicts words really well.

12
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,050
That's why it can chat.

13
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:22,840
A prompt is your instruction.

14
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,320
Better prompt, better answer.

15
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:26,420
Like giving directions to a very fast

16
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:26,880
intern.

17
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:28,830
Tokens are tiny chunks of text.

18
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,170
Not always full words.

19
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,380
The AI reads and writes in tokens.

20
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:34,170
The context window is the AI's

21
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:35,200
short-term memory.

22
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:37,490
If it gets full, older stuff falls out.

23
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:39,590
Training data is what helped teach the

24
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:39,970
model.

25
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,800
Inference is when it uses what it

26
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,670
learned to answer you.

27
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:44,800
A hallucination is when AI sounds

28
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,520
confident but gets the facts wrong.

29
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,500
Basically: fluent nonsense.

30
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:51,070
Embeddings turn meaning into numbers, so

31
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:53,210
AI can find ideas that are similar, not

32
00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:54,180
just exact words.

33
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:56,600
RAG means retrieval augmented

34
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:57,210
generation.

35
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,260
The AI checks outside sources before

36
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:01,050
answering, like open-book test mode.

37
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:03,040
An agent is AI that can take steps:

38
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:05,570
search, click, write, check, and keep

39
00:01:05,630 --> 00:01:06,530
going toward a goal.

40
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:07,560
That's the cheat sheet.

41
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:09,560
AI is less magic when the words stop

42
00:01:09,610 --> 00:01:10,140
being weird.

43
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:12,070
If you like AI explanation videos like

44
00:01:12,110 --> 00:01:13,870
this, like, subscribe, and follow for

45
00:01:13,930 --> 00:01:14,250
more.
